- Verifies that the game board initializes with a 15x15 grid.

Pseudocode:
```
CLASS Board
    FUNCTION __init__()
        INITIALIZE grid as a 2D list with 15 rows and 15 columns filled with None

    FUNCTION draw(screen)
        FOR EACH row in grid
            FOR EACH column in row
                CREATE rectangle with calculated position
                DRAW rectangle with default color
                IF grid[row][column] is "black"
                    DRAW black circle in rectangle center
                ELSE IF grid[row][column] is "white"
                    DRAW white circle in rectangle center
                DRAW border of rectangle in black
```

